1
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:51,940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

2
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,980
[Episode 30]
[This story is purely fictional]

3
00:01:56,350 --> 00:01:58,020
Now, let the tale begin.

4
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:01,620
Old secrets lie buried in dusty pages,

5
00:02:02,150 --> 00:02:04,830
and every healer has their secret remedy.

6
00:02:05,270 --> 00:02:06,400
Ladies and gentlemen,

7
00:02:06,670 --> 00:02:08,340
do you truly think

8
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:12,020
Master Zhang had run out of options?

9
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:13,300
Do you truly think

10
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:16,090
the heroes of the Mystic Nine had vanished?

11
00:02:16,830 --> 00:02:17,690
Not so.

12
00:02:18,320 --> 00:02:19,090
Not so.

13
00:02:19,710 --> 00:02:21,140
From the moment Master Zhang

14
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:22,460
entered the city,

15
00:02:22,550 --> 00:02:24,140
he already knew

16
00:02:24,550 --> 00:02:25,180
that this time,

17
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:27,690
the Mystic Nine were headed for a terrible ordeal.

18
00:02:28,510 --> 00:02:30,300
So before entering the city,

19
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:31,970
he made up his mind

20
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,900
to devise a plan,

21
00:02:34,390 --> 00:02:36,620
a flawless,

22
00:02:36,950 --> 00:02:39,300
airtight scheme

23
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:42,370
that would ultimately lead to one outcome:

24
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:43,460
the end

25
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:47,210
of the Mystic Nine.

26
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:48,810
And so,

27
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:51,420
on the day Wu Laogou was to be executed,

28
00:02:51,990 --> 00:02:53,460
people suddenly found

29
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:55,090
that all of Changsha

30
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:57,740
was bathed

31
00:02:59,270 --> 00:03:01,340
in brilliant starlight.

32
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:07,480
To make the Ministry of War

33
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:08,740
believe the Mystic Nine had been purged,

34
00:03:09,300 --> 00:03:10,370
Luo Ang was the key.

35
00:03:11,150 --> 00:03:12,380
Scheming and cunning,

36
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,940
he knew how deeply I cared

37
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:14,690
for the Mystic Nine

38
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,220
and how hard it'd be for me to act against them.

39
00:03:17,190 --> 00:03:17,940
So Luo Ang

40
00:03:18,430 --> 00:03:20,010
must have prepared for both possibilities.

41
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:21,540
On one hand,

42
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,060
he'd try his best to persuade me.

43
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:24,540
On the other,

44
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:27,380
he'd make sure the Mystic Nine would be wiped out.

45
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:30,010
Xie Jiu made himself part of the scheme...

46
00:03:30,030 --> 00:03:30,380
Master Zhang.

47
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:31,340
And made Luo believe

48
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,650
I'd been driven into a corner

49
00:03:32,650 --> 00:03:33,350
[Wu Laogou]

50
00:03:33,350 --> 00:03:34,300
[Executed]
and had no choice but to turn

51
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:35,780
[by Master Zhang in Person]
on the Mystic Nine to save myself.

52
00:03:37,350 --> 00:03:38,410
No one could've imagined

53
00:03:39,670 --> 00:03:40,780
we still had one final move,

54
00:03:41,830 --> 00:03:42,810
one that could turn the tide

55
00:03:43,670 --> 00:03:44,780
at the very last moment.

56
00:03:44,780 --> 00:03:47,660
[Favorable Weather]

57
00:03:51,020 --> 00:04:04,340
[United Hearts Society]

58
00:04:13,190 --> 00:04:13,700
Master Zhang.

59
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:15,740
Is everyone here?

60
00:04:16,230 --> 00:04:16,760
Yes.

61
00:04:17,190 --> 00:04:18,140
They're waiting for you inside.

62
00:04:26,820 --> 00:04:30,460
[The Mystic Nine United]

63
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,340
Master Zhang,

64
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:39,140
you're late.

65
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:41,700
Even Laogou got here before you.

66
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,340
Exactly, Master Zhang.

67
00:04:44,110 --> 00:04:45,060
You're buying

68
00:04:45,470 --> 00:04:46,420
the drinks today.

69
00:04:47,280 --> 00:04:48,340
Hurry and send Xiaoyu and Xiaojin

70
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:49,180
to get some wine.

71
00:04:49,470 --> 00:04:50,420
What?

72
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:52,700
Those two are still officially dead.

73
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:54,540
If they go outside and anyone sees them,

74
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,900
people will think they've seen ghosts.

75
00:04:58,080 --> 00:04:58,850
Dog brain.

76
00:04:59,470 --> 00:05:00,140
Bad memory.

77
00:05:02,750 --> 00:05:04,540
It's been confirmed that Luo Ang has left Changsha.

78
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:05,900
I was just

79
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,340
waiting for this.

80
00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:15,560
[Wu Laogou Executed]

81
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,260
Xiangu's reporter did a good job

82
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:19,900
and made me look quite handsome.

83
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:20,980
But you look rather...

84
00:05:28,030 --> 00:05:29,540
Thanks to Master Zhang's brilliant plan,

85
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,450
everything worked out perfectly.

86
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:33,940
Luo Ang personally supervised

87
00:05:35,190 --> 00:05:37,220
the purge of the Mystic Nine,

88
00:05:38,350 --> 00:05:39,330
and he also signed

89
00:05:39,350 --> 00:05:40,290
the final report himself.

90
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:42,450
If anyone grows suspicious in the future,

91
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,010
since he handled the case,

92
00:05:44,310 --> 00:05:46,140
he'll have no choice but to suppress it for us

93
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:48,420
to protect his own career.

94
00:05:48,910 --> 00:05:49,500
Wonderful.

95
00:05:49,950 --> 00:05:50,540
This time,

96
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,930
we're finally safe for good.

97
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:57,020
Now that the Mystic Nine

98
00:05:57,510 --> 00:05:58,540
no longer exists publicly,

99
00:05:58,750 --> 00:06:01,020
where will each of us go from here?

100
00:06:14,190 --> 00:06:15,050
I'm going to Beiping.

101
00:06:16,390 --> 00:06:17,250
Perhaps a new age

102
00:06:17,830 --> 00:06:18,730
really is coming.

103
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,810
I want to see for myself

104
00:06:21,630 --> 00:06:22,730
whether this new world

105
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,020
has a place for women

106
00:06:24,070 --> 00:06:24,930
to stand on their own.

107
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,340
If it does,

108
00:06:27,310 --> 00:06:28,540
I'll be the first.

109
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:32,780
I'm not leaving.

110
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:35,700
The people and things

111
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:37,540
I care about

112
00:06:38,390 --> 00:06:39,140
are all here.

113
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,020
Neither am I.

114
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:46,020
I'm tired.

115
00:06:47,630 --> 00:06:48,850
Changsha...

116
00:06:49,190 --> 00:06:50,900
I've fought for it and defended it.

117
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,700
I'm staying here.

118
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,810
The world is vast.

119
00:06:55,390 --> 00:06:56,410
I can go anywhere.

120
00:06:56,950 --> 00:06:58,490
If Changsha is no longer a place for me,

121
00:06:59,790 --> 00:07:01,460
perhaps I'll find somewhere better.

122
00:07:06,390 --> 00:07:07,020
Second Master,

123
00:07:09,190 --> 00:07:10,050
have you made any plans?

124
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,460
I've decided to return

125
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:17,410
to Guizhou tonight.

126
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:19,370
It's beautiful there.

127
00:07:20,430 --> 00:07:21,410
I've taken in a few disciples.

128
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,780
I'll teach them opera.

129
00:07:23,310 --> 00:07:24,250
We'll farm, study, and carry on our traditions.

130
00:07:24,950 --> 00:07:25,700
It'll be a peaceful life.

131
00:07:26,430 --> 00:07:26,900
Good.

132
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:31,140
And you?

133
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:33,220
Master Zhang,

134
00:07:33,950 --> 00:07:34,660
I've decided

135
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,610
where I'm going.

136
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,610
So have I.

137
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,810
I'll move to Hangzhou.

138
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,020
Xie Jiu wrote

139
00:07:46,390 --> 00:07:47,340
that it's a beautiful place.

140
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:50,610
I'll read books

141
00:07:50,750 --> 00:07:51,850
and compose poetry there.

142
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:52,930
It'll be nice.

143
00:08:01,870 --> 00:08:02,580
- Master Zhang. - Master Zhang.

144
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,900
These two jars were sealed when the Mystic Nine was founded.

145
00:08:09,070 --> 00:08:09,850
Should we

146
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,490
open them today?

147
00:08:26,270 --> 00:08:27,410
To Ninth Master.

148
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:29,540
To Ninth Master.

149
00:08:40,180 --> 00:08:43,540
♪A handful of homeland soil carries the scent of dust...♪

150
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:46,420
Until we meet again.

151
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:48,300
Until we meet again.

152
00:08:50,260 --> 00:08:53,420
♪A single bright lamp preserves your image♪

153
00:08:54,700 --> 00:08:58,580
♪My life belongs to distant lands, with no room to dwell on love♪

154
00:09:00,300 --> 00:09:03,540
♪Holding a pool of autumn water, we share the same robe♪

155
00:09:05,220 --> 00:09:08,660
♪You sit in your lone city while I protect my hometown♪

156
00:09:10,180 --> 00:09:14,540
♪I dip my brush into the western wind to paint the setting sun♪

157
00:09:14,860 --> 00:09:19,220
♪The returning ravens are too noisy, how can I fight back?♪

158
00:09:20,140 --> 00:09:24,500
♪The land turns barren and old, the memories come flooding back♪

159
00:09:24,820 --> 00:09:29,660
♪Every moment with you appears in my heart♪

160
00:09:30,020 --> 00:09:34,620
♪My burning heart turns ashen, my hair turns white♪

161
00:09:35,060 --> 00:09:39,820
♪I look at you whilst I yearn for you♪

162
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:44,420
♪The land is barren, the snow is thick, the longing is endless♪

163
00:09:44,740 --> 00:09:49,500
♪Thousand miles apart, with whom are you enjoying the good moments?♪

164
00:09:49,940 --> 00:09:54,540
♪It's just a dream, it's just my duty♪

165
00:09:54,900 --> 00:10:00,940
♪Trading my life for your safety♪

166
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:14,370
Did he say anything

167
00:10:15,870 --> 00:10:16,820
before he died?

168
00:10:18,550 --> 00:10:20,100
Ninth Master said he was honored to do it all

169
00:10:21,550 --> 00:10:22,730
as the last of the Mystic Nine.

170
00:10:23,030 --> 00:10:24,530
The foundation of the Mystic Nine

171
00:10:24,630 --> 00:10:25,850
lies with its top leader.

172
00:10:26,030 --> 00:10:27,460
He must be righteous and strong

173
00:10:27,630 --> 00:10:28,700
and never take the wrong path.

174
00:10:28,870 --> 00:10:29,940
As for the difficult things

175
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,250
that still must be done,

176
00:10:31,390 --> 00:10:33,180
the Xie Clan will take them on.

177
00:10:33,670 --> 00:10:34,980
I will bear the consequences myself.

178
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,370
As long as I can protect the Mystic Nine

179
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,370
and serve the people,

180
00:10:37,550 --> 00:10:38,420
it will be worth it.

181
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:40,650
Jiu,

182
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,300
you did so much

183
00:10:47,790 --> 00:10:48,940
and helped so many people.

184
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:53,720
Yet in the end, people on the streets

185
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:54,890
call you a traitor

186
00:10:57,670 --> 00:10:58,770
and a lackey.

187
00:11:02,750 --> 00:11:03,420
Was it worth it?

188
00:11:05,060 --> 00:11:09,380
♪The land is barren, the snow is thick, the longing is endless♪

189
00:11:09,700 --> 00:11:14,460
♪Thousand miles apart, with whom are you enjoying the good moments?♪

190
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:19,460
♪It's just a dream, it's just my duty...♪

191
00:11:19,460 --> 00:11:21,020
[Master Zhang Leads the Mystic Nine in Securing Southern Changsha]

192
00:11:21,020 --> 00:11:25,020
[Romance of the Three Kingdoms]

193
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:29,700
So the Mystic Nine

194
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:31,580
are really gone?

195
00:11:35,150 --> 00:11:36,250
What do you think?

196
00:11:37,270 --> 00:11:37,940
Child,

197
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:40,370
the heroes of the Sui and Tang dynasties

198
00:11:40,510 --> 00:11:41,300
were mighty, weren't they?

199
00:11:42,150 --> 00:11:42,890
They're gone.

200
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:45,850
The Wei, Shu, and Wu Kingdoms once divided the realm.

201
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,770
Are they still standing today?

202
00:11:48,550 --> 00:11:50,600
Even Zhang Fei and Guan Yunchang

203
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:51,650
are long gone.

204
00:11:53,390 --> 00:11:53,940
Here.

205
00:11:53,940 --> 00:11:55,200
[Romance of the Three Kingdoms]

206
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:56,370
Look at this book.

207
00:11:56,870 --> 00:11:58,580
All the heroes in here

208
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:01,770
are gone the moment you

209
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:03,940
turn the page.

210
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:06,850
That's why the old saying goes,

211
00:12:07,270 --> 00:12:10,010
"Every hero must one day leave the stage."

212
00:12:10,510 --> 00:12:11,770
But there's another old saying:

213
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:14,460
"Every age brings forth its own heroes,

214
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:17,100
each leaving their mark for centuries."

215
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:19,650
I once read in the newspaper

216
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:22,770
that as long as the spirit of the people endures,

217
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:25,610
the bright future of China

218
00:12:25,870 --> 00:12:27,530
will one day rest

219
00:12:27,630 --> 00:12:31,300
in the hands of every Chinese citizen.

220
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:33,250
Bravo!

221
00:12:33,630 --> 00:12:35,890
Though the Mystic Nine went their separate ways,

222
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,250
each following a different path,

223
00:12:37,590 --> 00:12:40,980
after their story ended, the world changed drastically

224
00:12:41,150 --> 00:12:45,220
and underwent a cataclysmic upheaval.

225
00:12:46,550 --> 00:12:47,820
"Today, the responsibility

226
00:12:48,510 --> 00:12:49,250
lies not with others,

227
00:12:49,250 --> 00:12:50,440
[Guizhou]

228
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,890
but entirely with us, the young.

229
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:56,820
If the youth are wise, the nation will be wise."

230
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:58,880
[Young China]

231
00:12:58,900 --> 00:13:00,700
"If the youth are wise, the nation will be wise."

232
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:04,300
"If the youth are strong, the nation will be strong."

233
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:07,650
"If the youth are strong, the nation will be strong."

234
00:13:07,790 --> 00:13:08,530
Mr. Hong.

235
00:13:16,910 --> 00:13:17,490
Sir.

236
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,730
Thank you for taking care

237
00:13:21,670 --> 00:13:22,700
of our fallen soldiers' children.

238
00:13:23,630 --> 00:13:24,530
We will never forget

239
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:26,650
your kindness.

240
00:13:27,670 --> 00:13:28,490
The 20 dan of grain

241
00:13:28,910 --> 00:13:30,820
and five cases of sulfa drugs

242
00:13:30,960 --> 00:13:31,980
you sent recently,

243
00:13:32,390 --> 00:13:34,420
along with 30 Hanyang rifles,

244
00:13:34,750 --> 00:13:36,010
have all arrived safely.

245
00:13:36,550 --> 00:13:37,890
They came just when we needed them most

246
00:13:38,390 --> 00:13:40,010
and solved an urgent problem for us.

247
00:13:41,150 --> 00:13:42,010
It's just...

248
00:13:42,630 --> 00:13:43,130
Sir,

249
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:45,340
come with me.

250
00:13:52,870 --> 00:13:53,490
A radio?

251
00:13:56,360 --> 00:13:57,340
How did you get this?

252
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:00,010
Wonderful!

253
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:01,420
It really wasn't easy to obtain.

254
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:04,220
I had to pull a lot of strings

255
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:05,650
to get it here

256
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:06,980
last night.

257
00:14:07,510 --> 00:14:08,820
This is wonderful.

258
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:10,820
These days, we've had no way

259
00:14:11,270 --> 00:14:12,250
to contact our superiors

260
00:14:12,270 --> 00:14:13,530
without a radio.

261
00:14:13,910 --> 00:14:14,700
You've really done us

262
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:15,650
a tremendous favor.

263
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:16,490
Mr. Hong,

264
00:14:16,910 --> 00:14:18,250
you're a miracle worker.

265
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:19,530
Thank you.

266
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:21,010
Thank you so much.

267
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:21,980
Thank you.

268
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:23,060
Thank you.

269
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,010
Yatou,

270
00:14:59,510 --> 00:15:00,530
I've made you suffer again.

271
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:02,490
Just wait a bit longer.

272
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:05,700
Soon, we'll see

273
00:15:06,670 --> 00:15:07,650
a world at peace.

274
00:15:11,150 --> 00:15:11,650
Look.

275
00:15:13,910 --> 00:15:14,700
I've prepared

276
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:15,890
a coffin for myself.

277
00:15:16,870 --> 00:15:18,220
I even had it made a little taller.

278
00:15:24,390 --> 00:15:25,370
When my time finally comes,

279
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,370
we'll be together just as before.

280
00:15:32,910 --> 00:15:34,850
You'll rest quietly against my shoulder

281
00:15:40,910 --> 00:15:42,180
and listen to me sing.

282
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:03,980
Be careful.

283
00:16:04,150 --> 00:16:04,530
All right.

284
00:16:08,910 --> 00:16:09,490
Hold it tight.

285
00:16:10,150 --> 00:16:10,890
Tie it securely.

286
00:16:12,390 --> 00:16:13,420
Don't leave it loose.

287
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:20,250
Third Master,

288
00:16:20,790 --> 00:16:21,700
everything's loaded.

289
00:16:21,910 --> 00:16:22,490
We're ready to go.

290
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:24,730
Coming.

291
00:16:33,550 --> 00:16:33,980
Go.

292
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:36,010
The earlier you leave,

293
00:16:37,030 --> 00:16:38,730
the fewer people you'll meet on the way.

294
00:16:46,150 --> 00:16:48,940
One, two, three, four.

295
00:16:58,910 --> 00:17:00,060
I know what you're going to do.

296
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:06,050
Go and do what you have to.

297
00:17:07,790 --> 00:17:08,700
Don't worry about us.

298
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:37,700
Don't worry.

299
00:17:41,030 --> 00:17:42,700
I'll take good care of our son

300
00:17:45,590 --> 00:17:47,180
and keep him safe as he grows up.

301
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:57,770
Good.

302
00:18:23,680 --> 00:18:24,220
We're off.

303
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:28,980
Come on, Yan.

304
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:32,050
Son.

305
00:18:38,110 --> 00:18:39,140
Goodbye, Father.

306
00:18:44,480 --> 00:18:45,220
Goodbye, son.

307
00:19:02,590 --> 00:19:03,730
Goodbye, Father.

308
00:19:31,180 --> 00:19:32,900
[Prosperity for Five Generations]

309
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:42,460
Ms. Bai left too?

310
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:47,560
You know

311
00:19:47,560 --> 00:19:48,600
what she's like.

312
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:49,500
Stubborn as ever.

313
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:51,180
She refused to leave.

314
00:19:51,790 --> 00:19:54,090
But then she went

315
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:56,290
and got pregnant with my child.

316
00:19:57,720 --> 00:19:58,620
Even I, Heibei Laoliu,

317
00:19:59,310 --> 00:20:00,380
am going to be a father.

318
00:20:06,350 --> 00:20:08,050
What's it like being a father?

319
00:20:10,750 --> 00:20:11,140
Never mind.

320
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:14,730
With your situation,

321
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:15,980
you wouldn't know.

322
00:20:16,070 --> 00:20:17,090
Why wouldn't I know?

323
00:20:18,270 --> 00:20:19,010
My son

324
00:20:19,030 --> 00:20:20,460
calls me Father now.

325
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:22,490
Your son calls you Father now?

326
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:23,860
Of course.

327
00:20:24,790 --> 00:20:25,940
Your sister-in-law agreed to it?

328
00:20:29,030 --> 00:20:30,180
Call her Third Sister-in-law from now on.

329
00:20:35,830 --> 00:20:37,030
Now that's worth celebrating.

330
00:20:37,030 --> 00:20:37,980
- Come on. - We're both fathers.

331
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:38,980
- Come on. - Let's have a drink.

332
00:20:39,070 --> 00:20:39,570
Cheers.

333
00:20:44,590 --> 00:20:46,510
In the old days, whenever goods

334
00:20:46,510 --> 00:20:47,570
entered Changsha,

335
00:20:48,680 --> 00:20:50,050
they had to pass through the Mystic Nine.

336
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:53,140
Now that the Japanese are here,

337
00:20:54,350 --> 00:20:55,770
that rule can't change.

338
00:20:58,750 --> 00:20:59,380
Exactly.

339
00:21:02,590 --> 00:21:03,900
Someone has to stay behind

340
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:06,380
and keep the road ahead

341
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:08,900
guarded.

342
00:21:12,550 --> 00:21:12,980
Come on.

343
00:21:13,790 --> 00:21:14,220
Cheers.

344
00:21:17,270 --> 00:21:18,090
This is bad!

345
00:21:18,310 --> 00:21:19,460
The Japanese have broken into the city!

346
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:20,570
Run!

347
00:21:21,270 --> 00:21:22,290
The Japanese are here!

348
00:21:24,350 --> 00:21:24,940
Run!

349
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:25,980
The Japanese are here!

350
00:21:53,720 --> 00:21:55,530
How many men do you still have?

351
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:57,250
None of them left.

352
00:23:04,790 --> 00:23:06,420
The sky sure is red today.

353
00:23:07,960 --> 00:23:09,620
Perfect for a good fight.

354
00:23:10,830 --> 00:23:11,860
One last battle

355
00:23:12,680 --> 00:23:14,010
for Changsha.

356
00:24:08,300 --> 00:24:09,580
[Xiangchun Gate]

357
00:24:15,660 --> 00:24:20,140
[Xiangchun Gate]

358
00:24:21,500 --> 00:24:24,550
[Guangxi]

359
00:24:24,550 --> 00:24:25,530
Get him!

360
00:24:27,400 --> 00:24:28,660
He must be nearby.

361
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:30,330
He's killed so many of our men.

362
00:24:30,720 --> 00:24:33,220
I'll kill him myself!

363
00:24:33,350 --> 00:24:34,380
Find him!

364
00:25:53,590 --> 00:25:55,050
It's... It's you.

365
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:05,980
Look at this.

366
00:26:06,920 --> 00:26:08,700
A new dog-training facility opened in Hangzhou.

367
00:26:09,070 --> 00:26:09,860
They say the dogs there

368
00:26:10,030 --> 00:26:11,810
can sniff out buried land mines,

369
00:26:12,240 --> 00:26:13,530
patrol, carry messages,

370
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:14,490
catch thieves,

371
00:26:14,590 --> 00:26:15,290
and find food.

372
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:17,660
[Master Dog Trainer]
Far better than the foreign police

373
00:26:17,750 --> 00:26:18,620
[Hidden in Hangzhou Dog-Training Kennel]
in the concession.

374
00:26:18,620 --> 00:26:19,660
[Hunan Master Works Wonders with Dogs]

375
00:26:20,070 --> 00:26:21,250
Sounds like boasting to me.

376
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:22,770
No matter how clever a dog is,

377
00:26:22,830 --> 00:26:24,140
it can't work miracles, can it?

378
00:26:25,270 --> 00:26:26,140
You'd be surprised.

379
00:26:26,270 --> 00:26:27,250
The paper says

380
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:29,190
there's a master dog trainer there.

381
00:26:29,400 --> 00:26:30,660
Apparently, he's incredibly skilled,

382
00:26:31,030 --> 00:26:32,860
but he never shows his face.

383
00:26:33,400 --> 00:26:34,490
They say he isn't a local.

384
00:26:35,030 --> 00:26:37,140
He came from Changsha

385
00:26:37,880 --> 00:26:39,810
and married into a family in Hangzhou,

386
00:26:39,830 --> 00:26:40,940
then settled down there.

387
00:26:44,640 --> 00:26:45,420
Who are you?

388
00:26:46,960 --> 00:26:47,530
Hey, miss,

389
00:26:47,640 --> 00:26:48,620
what's the matter with you?

390
00:26:49,510 --> 00:26:50,290
Forget it.

391
00:26:50,830 --> 00:26:51,460
That's enough money

392
00:26:51,480 --> 00:26:52,380
to buy ten newspapers.

393
00:26:52,640 --> 00:26:53,180
Let's eat.

394
00:27:07,460 --> 00:27:11,750
[Hangzhou]

395
00:27:11,750 --> 00:27:12,330
Master,

396
00:27:13,070 --> 00:27:14,490
things are going smoothly at the dog kennel.

397
00:27:15,310 --> 00:27:17,380
We've trained over 30 dogs now.

398
00:27:18,240 --> 00:27:18,940
They can scout sentry posts and find routes,

399
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:20,220
patrol borders and guard supplies,

400
00:27:20,640 --> 00:27:21,330
and even carry messages.

401
00:27:22,350 --> 00:27:23,180
A few of the dogs

402
00:27:23,640 --> 00:27:24,530
went with Second Master's men

403
00:27:24,550 --> 00:27:25,180
to Guizhou.

404
00:27:26,510 --> 00:27:27,570
They helped them slip past several checkpoints

405
00:27:27,960 --> 00:27:28,940
and transport

406
00:27:29,030 --> 00:27:29,900
a good deal of supplies.

407
00:27:31,830 --> 00:27:32,810
Keep looking for dogs.

408
00:27:33,510 --> 00:27:34,140
The more, the better.

409
00:27:35,030 --> 00:27:36,250
Bring back every dog we can train.

410
00:27:36,880 --> 00:27:38,730
We need to train at least 100,

411
00:27:38,920 --> 00:27:39,490
even 1,000.

412
00:27:40,510 --> 00:27:42,250
Only by spreading them far and wide

413
00:27:42,830 --> 00:27:43,730
can they truly make a difference

414
00:27:44,720 --> 00:27:46,420
to the war effort.

415
00:27:49,780 --> 00:28:01,340
[Western Heaven Within Reach]

416
00:28:03,860 --> 00:28:06,440
[Western Heaven Within Reach]

417
00:28:06,440 --> 00:28:07,260
"Western Heaven

418
00:28:08,960 --> 00:28:10,010
Within Reach."

419
00:28:10,870 --> 00:28:11,490
Master,

420
00:28:12,280 --> 00:28:13,380
what does that mean?

421
00:28:13,990 --> 00:28:15,060
Does it mean reaching the destination?

422
00:28:20,600 --> 00:28:21,650
I used to think

423
00:28:22,510 --> 00:28:23,780
that once Sun Wukong and his companions

424
00:28:23,800 --> 00:28:24,780
reached the Western Heaven,

425
00:28:25,760 --> 00:28:27,300
they would obtain the True Scriptures.

426
00:28:28,550 --> 00:28:29,420
But now I understand.

427
00:28:30,230 --> 00:28:31,300
Just reaching the destination

428
00:28:32,040 --> 00:28:33,020
doesn't mean the journey is complete.

429
00:28:34,360 --> 00:28:36,100
If your heart is still trapped in its old shell,

430
00:28:37,590 --> 00:28:38,620
even with the Western Heaven

431
00:28:38,640 --> 00:28:39,700
right before your eyes,

432
00:28:41,150 --> 00:28:41,980
it can still feel

433
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:44,490
thousands of mountains and rivers away.

434
00:28:46,400 --> 00:28:47,770
What does that mean, Master?

435
00:28:52,400 --> 00:28:54,380
It means you should trust me.

436
00:28:55,960 --> 00:28:56,730
I'll lead you

437
00:28:58,000 --> 00:28:59,220
to the True Scriptures.

438
00:29:00,940 --> 00:29:05,180
[Battlefront]

439
00:29:28,310 --> 00:29:28,850
Reporting!

440
00:29:30,350 --> 00:29:31,290
The Japanese vanguard

441
00:29:31,480 --> 00:29:32,540
has broken through the Xiling defenses.

442
00:29:32,840 --> 00:29:33,820
Our southern position has fallen.

443
00:29:34,150 --> 00:29:34,820
Our forces

444
00:29:35,160 --> 00:29:35,900
number fewer than 3,000.

445
00:29:36,520 --> 00:29:37,770
The enemy outnumbers us more than three to one.

446
00:29:38,110 --> 00:29:39,420
Order all combat units

447
00:29:39,830 --> 00:29:40,940
into battle.

448
00:29:41,310 --> 00:29:42,250
Issue all available ammunition.

449
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:43,700
Hold the line

450
00:29:44,000 --> 00:29:45,220
and fight to the last man!

451
00:29:45,440 --> 00:29:45,810
Yes, sir!

452
00:29:49,110 --> 00:29:50,220
Reporting, Master Zhang.

453
00:29:50,790 --> 00:29:51,460
Our forward scouts

454
00:29:51,550 --> 00:29:52,770
found an unidentified man.

455
00:29:53,160 --> 00:29:55,140
He claims to be an old acquaintance of yours.

456
00:29:56,830 --> 00:29:57,490
What's his name?

457
00:29:57,830 --> 00:29:58,460
He refused to give one.

458
00:29:58,880 --> 00:29:59,700
He only asked me to tell you

459
00:30:00,100 --> 00:30:02,320
he could help raise the stakes once more.

460
00:30:27,590 --> 00:30:28,090
Master Zhang.

461
00:30:33,750 --> 00:30:34,660
Comrade Zhang Qishan.

462
00:30:42,830 --> 00:30:43,380
Don't worry.

463
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:45,180
I've arranged two teams.

464
00:30:45,880 --> 00:30:48,330
One is lying in wait on the southern slope of Shiling.

465
00:30:48,680 --> 00:30:49,290
The other

466
00:30:49,590 --> 00:30:51,620
has infiltrated their supply line.

467
00:30:53,310 --> 00:30:54,290
If your men can keep

468
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:55,570
the enemy's right flank in check,

469
00:30:55,960 --> 00:30:56,980
we can launch

470
00:30:57,000 --> 00:30:57,700
a counterattack.

471
00:30:58,550 --> 00:30:59,460
With a well-timed

472
00:30:59,920 --> 00:31:01,220
pincer movement,

473
00:31:01,480 --> 00:31:01,980
3,000 men

474
00:31:02,750 --> 00:31:03,490
may still be able to tear open

475
00:31:03,550 --> 00:31:04,330
a gap in their lines.

476
00:31:04,750 --> 00:31:05,460
Exactly.

477
00:31:06,510 --> 00:31:07,380
We may be outnumbered,

478
00:31:07,750 --> 00:31:09,420
but if we strike precisely and cleverly,

479
00:31:09,750 --> 00:31:11,180
we still have a chance to win.

480
00:31:33,940 --> 00:31:38,340
♪The land turns barren and old, the memories come flooding back♪

481
00:31:38,660 --> 00:31:43,500
♪Every moment with you appears in my heart♪

482
00:31:43,820 --> 00:31:48,580
♪My burning heart turns ashen, my hair turns white♪

483
00:31:48,820 --> 00:31:53,780
♪I look at you whilst I yearn for you♪

484
00:31:53,900 --> 00:31:58,420
♪The land is barren, the snow is thick, the longing is endless♪

485
00:31:58,620 --> 00:32:03,420
♪Thousand miles apart, with whom are you enjoying the good moments?♪

486
00:32:04,340 --> 00:32:08,860
[Western Heaven Within Reach]

487
00:32:08,860 --> 00:32:13,820
♪Trading my life for your safety♪

488
00:32:13,940 --> 00:32:18,340
♪The land turns barren and old, the memories come flooding back...♪

489
00:32:18,340 --> 00:32:22,900
[Western Heaven Within Reach]

490
00:32:24,920 --> 00:32:26,330
Grandfather's notes say

491
00:32:27,270 --> 00:32:28,140
that in the end,

492
00:32:28,200 --> 00:32:29,660
they all found their own paths.

493
00:32:30,640 --> 00:32:32,380
But did they really reach their Western Heaven

494
00:32:32,920 --> 00:32:34,010
and obtain the True Scriptures?

495
00:32:36,440 --> 00:32:37,330
Grandfather said

496
00:32:38,240 --> 00:32:39,140
he didn't know either.

497
00:32:43,860 --> 00:32:48,420
♪It's just a dream, it's just my duty♪

498
00:32:48,860 --> 00:32:55,700
♪Trading my life for your safety♪

499
00:32:58,220 --> 00:33:03,020
[Wu Xie, Wu Laogou's grandson]

500
00:33:05,110 --> 00:33:06,050
Is the owner here?

501
00:33:06,310 --> 00:33:07,730
Do you buy rubbings?

502
00:33:08,640 --> 00:33:09,290
Yes.

503
00:33:13,300 --> 00:33:17,420
[The End]

504
00:33:34,980 --> 00:33:39,140
♪The past fades like smoke♪

505
00:33:39,500 --> 00:33:42,220
♪A choice is made in silence♪

506
00:33:42,500 --> 00:33:45,300
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

507
00:33:45,700 --> 00:33:49,460
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

508
00:33:49,700 --> 00:33:53,140
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

509
00:33:53,420 --> 00:33:56,820
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

510
00:33:56,900 --> 00:34:04,180
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

511
00:34:04,620 --> 00:34:07,900
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

512
00:34:08,180 --> 00:34:11,420
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

513
00:34:11,580 --> 00:34:15,620
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

514
00:34:15,820 --> 00:34:19,180
♪Who believes in fate?♪

515
00:34:19,420 --> 00:34:22,780
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

516
00:34:23,020 --> 00:34:26,300
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

517
00:34:26,620 --> 00:34:30,300
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

518
00:34:30,500 --> 00:34:33,740
♪Take care♪

519
00:34:33,740 --> 00:34:36,300
♪We once raced♪

520
00:34:36,380 --> 00:34:38,300
♪For the dawn♪

521
00:34:38,460 --> 00:34:41,740
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

522
00:34:41,860 --> 00:34:45,140
♪In the web of fate♪

523
00:34:45,140 --> 00:34:48,340
♪No one can escape♪

524
00:34:49,340 --> 00:34:51,180
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

525
00:34:51,340 --> 00:34:52,900
♪We too were young once♪

526
00:34:52,980 --> 00:34:56,420
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

527
00:34:56,620 --> 00:34:58,940
♪Keep the ember lit♪

528
00:34:59,060 --> 00:35:03,580
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

529
00:35:03,700 --> 00:35:06,660
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

530
00:35:06,900 --> 00:35:10,420
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

531
00:35:10,540 --> 00:35:14,300
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

532
00:35:14,620 --> 00:35:18,100
♪Who believes in fate?♪

533
00:35:18,260 --> 00:35:21,260
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

534
00:35:21,500 --> 00:35:25,260
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

535
00:35:25,420 --> 00:35:29,140
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

536
00:35:29,260 --> 00:35:40,700
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
